le changes can require a fresh sign-in.</Text></Shape><Shape ID="47" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>12.89467027452257</PinX><PinY>1.4217686123318143</PinY><Width>4.039340549045139</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>2.0196702745225696</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.18055555555555555</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>Assigned Documents requires both user-view and</Text></Shape><Shape ID="48" Type="Shape" LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><XForm><PinX>12.101758321126303</PinX><PinY>1.1550788879394531</PinY><Width>2.453516642252604</Width><Height>0.31752777099609375</Height><LocPinX>1.226758321126302</LocPinX><LocPinY>0.15876388549804688</LocPinY></XForm><Fill><FillPattern>0</FillPattern></Fill><Line><LinePattern>0</LinePattern></Line><TextBlock><LeftMargin>0</LeftMargin><RightMargin>0</RightMargin><TopMargin>0</TopMargin><BottomMargin>0</BottomMargin><VerticalAlign>0</VerticalAlign></TextBlock><Char IX="0"><Font>0</Font><Size>0.18055555555555555</Size><Style>0</Style><Color>#233247</Color></Char><Para IX="0"><HorzAlign>0</HorzAlign></Para><Text>direct-assignment permission.</Text></Shape></Shapes></Page><Page ID="18" NameU="Page-19" Name="Maintain roles and permissions"><PageSheet LineStyle="0" FillStyle="0" TextStyle="0"><PageProps><PageWidth Unit="IN">16.52777777777778</PageWidth><PageHeight Unit="IN">11.694444444444445</PageHeight><PageScale Unit="IN">1</PageScale><DrawingScale Unit="IN">1</DrawingScale></PageProps><PrintProps><PrintPageOrientation>2</PrintPageOrientation></PrintProps></PageSheet><Shapes><Shape ID="1" Type="Shape" LineStyle=